{"version": 2, "width": 160, "height": 50, "timestamp": 1787132892, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-ghostty"}, "title": "CEO Identity Descoping for AI Agents — OpenShell + Keycloak RFC 8693"}
[3.040616, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[3.041375, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  CEO Identity Descoping for AI Agents\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[4.046306, "o", "  \u001b[1mOpenShell sandbox + Keycloak RHBK on ROSA HCP\u001b[0m\r\n  RFC 8693 Token Exchange — User Identity Delegation\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mScenario:\u001b[0m A bank CEO logs in. An AI agent acts on their behalf.\r\n"]
[4.046384, "o", "  The agent should \u001b[0;32msee what the CEO sees\u001b[0m, but \u001b[0;31mNOT do\u001b[0m what the CEO can do.\r\n  This is the \u001b[1mRHAIRFE-2567\u001b[0m RFE: user identity delegation with blast radius reduction.\r\n\r\n"]
[8.057089, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.057397, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Architecture\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[9.07007, "o", "  \u001b[1mCluster:\u001b[0m akram-dev (ROSA HCP 4.22, us-east-2)\r\n\r\n                    \u001b[0;35mCEO\u001b[0m                                          \u001b[0;36mAnalyst\u001b[0m\r\n                     |                                               |\r\n"]
[9.070188, "o", "                     | login (username/password)                     | login\r\n                     v                                               v\r\n          \u001b[0;32m+-------------------+\u001b[0m                                              \r\n          \u001b[0;32m|     Keycloak      |\u001b[0m  namespace: \u001b[0;36mkeycloak\u001b[0m\r\n          \u001b[0;32m|  realm: bank-demo |\u001b[0m  RHBK v26.6 (operator)\r\n          \u001b[0;32m+-------------------+\u001b[0m\r\n            |               |\r\n"]
[9.0702, "o", "            | full token    | descoped token (RFC 8693 exchange)\r\n"]
[9.070245, "o", "            | (all scopes)  | (read-only scopes)\r\n"]
[9.070269, "o", "            v               v\r\n    \u001b[0;32mCEO direct\u001b[0m     \u001b[0;36m+---------------------+\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.070292, "o", "    (browser,      \u001b[0;36m| OpenShell Gateway   |\u001b[0m  namespace: \u001b[0;36mopenshell-system\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.070315, "o", "     API call)     \u001b[0;36m| v0.0.98             |\u001b[0m  inference routing, provider mgmt\r\n                   \u001b[0;36m+---------------------+\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.070325, "o", "                            |\r\n                            | creates & manages\r\n"]
[9.070369, "o", "                            v\r\n                   \u001b[0;36m+---------------------+\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.070377, "o", "                   \u001b[0;36m| Sandbox Pod         |\u001b[0m  namespace: \u001b[0;36mclaude-sandboxed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.070407, "o", "                   \u001b[0;36m| (agent runs here)   |\u001b[0m  network-isolated, no credentials\r\n"]
[9.070428, "o", "                   \u001b[0;36m| L7 proxy + OPA      |\u001b[0m  token injected at proxy level\r\n"]
[9.070435, "o", "                   \u001b[0;36m+---------------------+\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.070521, "o", "                            |\r\n                            | descoped Bearer token\r\n                            v\r\n                   \u001b[1;33m+---------------------+\u001b[0m\r\n                   \u001b[1;33m| bank-api            |\u001b[0m  namespace: \u001b[0;36mdefault\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.070537, "o", "                   \u001b[1;33m| /accounts           |\u001b[0m  validates token, enforces scopes\r\n"]
[9.070593, "o", "                   \u001b[1;33m| /transfers          |\u001b[0m  returns data based on sub + scope\r\n                   \u001b[1;33m+---------------------+\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[13.078425, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Keycloak clients — this is where descoping is configured\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.086106, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.086164, "o", "  \u001b[0;32mbank-gateway\u001b[0m  (Keycloak client for human users)\r\n"]
[14.086366, "o", "    clientId:         openshell-gateway\r\n    fullScopeAllowed: \u001b[0;32mtrue\u001b[0m\r\n    scopes:           accounts.read, \u001b[0;32maccounts.write\u001b[0m, transfers.read, \u001b[0;32mtransfers.write\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[14.08651, "o", "  \u001b[0;36mbank-agent\u001b[0m    (Keycloak client for AI agents — descoped)\r\n    clientId:         agent-sandbox\r\n    fullScopeAllowed: \u001b[0;31mfalse\u001b[0m\r\n    scopes:           accounts.read, transfers.read\r\n"]
[14.086598, "o", "    \u001b[0;31mNOT assigned:     accounts.write, transfers.write\u001b[0m\r\n    token-exchange:   \u001b[0;32menabled\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[14.086674, "o", "  \u001b[2mThe agent client CANNOT obtain write scopes — Keycloak enforces this,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.08675, "o", "  \u001b[2mnot the agent or the sandbox. Even if the agent requests write scopes,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mKeycloak will refuse to include them in the exchanged token.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.08677, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.092805, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Cluster state — pods running\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.10255, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.102641, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc get pods -n keycloak -l app=keycloak\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.134134, "o", "keycloak-0   1/1   Running   0     95m\r\n"]
[20.141076, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.141244, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc get pods -n openshell-system -l app.kubernetes.io/name=openshell\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[21.150543, "o", "openshell-0   1/1   Running   0     105m\r\n"]
[21.157849, "o", "\r\n"]
[21.158052, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc get pods -n claude-sandboxed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.29249, "o", "claude-sandbox            1/1   Running   0     37h\r\ndefault--claude-sandbox   1/1   Running   0     36h\r\n"]
[22.300679, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.30077, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc get pods -n default -l app=bank-api\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.795249, "o", "bank-api-c7fdb55b5-6dncg   1/1   Running   0     104m\r\n"]
[23.801677, "o", "\r\n"]
[26.810311, "o", "\r\n"]
[26.810587, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  The Sandbox — where the agent runs\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[26.810628, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[27.822162, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Sandbox overview\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.834731, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox get claude-sandbox\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.834839, "o", "\r\n"]
[30.129238, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36mSandbox:\u001b[39m\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mId:\u001b[0m 2ee565cd-a10b-4dfc-aaea-572b5182aebc\r\n  \u001b[2mName:\u001b[0m claude-sandbox\r\n  \u001b[2mPhase:\u001b[0m Ready\r\n  \u001b[2mResource version:\u001b[0m 2173\r\n  \u001b[2mPolicy source:\u001b[0m sandbox\r\n  \u001b[2mRevision:\u001b[0m 2\r\n\r\n"]
[30.129507, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36mPolicy:\u001b[39m\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[30.131253, "o", "  \u001b[2mversion\u001b[0m\u001b[2m:\u001b[0m 1\r\n  \u001b[2mfilesystem_policy\u001b[0m\u001b[2m:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2minclude_workdir\u001b[0m\u001b[2m:\u001b[0m true\r\n    \u001b[2mread_only\u001b[0m\u001b[2m:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.134895, "o", "\r\n"]
[32.145694, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Inside the sandbox — the agent's view\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.157284, "o", "\r\n"]
[33.157411, "o", "\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- whoami\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[34.505792, "o", "sandbox\r\r\n"]
[34.554136, "o", "\r\n"]
[34.554372, "o", "\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- hostname\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[35.912564, "o", "default--claude-sandbox\r\r\n"]
[35.958842, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- printenv | grep -E 'ANTHROPIC|BASE_URL'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.295586, "o", "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=unused\r\nANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://inference.local\r\n"]
[37.344048, "o", "\r\n"]
[37.344771, "o", "  The agent runs as user \u001b[0;36msandbox\u001b[0m in an isolated pod.\r\n  It uses \u001b[1minference.local\u001b[0m for LLM calls — \u001b[0;31mno API keys in the sandbox\u001b[0m.\r\n"]
[37.345009, "o", "  Access: \u001b[1mopenshell sandbox connect claude-sandbox\u001b[0m (SSH)\r\n      or: \u001b[1mopenshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox --tty -- bash\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[40.358789, "o", "\r\n"]
[40.358999, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 1: CEO logs in — full permissions\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[41.371065, "o", "  \u001b[0;35m\u001b[1m[CEO]\u001b[0m I authenticate directly via Keycloak. I get all bank scopes.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ CEO authenticates via Keycloak\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.377769, "o", "\r\n"]
[42.377863, "o", "  \u001b[2m# CEO logs in with the bank-gateway client (openshell-gateway)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.378143, "o", "  \u001b[2m# This client has fullScopeAllowed=true → all scopes granted\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m$ curl -X POST $KEYCLOAK/realms/bank-demo/protocol/openid-connect/token \\033[0m\r\n\u001b[1m    -d client_id=openshell-gateway \\033[0m\r\n\u001b[1m    -d grant_type=password -d username=ceo \\033[0m\r\n\u001b[1m    -d scope='accounts.read accounts.write transfers.read transfers.write'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.37828, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.625288, "o", "\u001b[1mCEO token claims:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[43.65851, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"preferred_username\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"email\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"openid accounts.read transfers.write profile email transfers.read accounts.write\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"azp\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"openshell-gateway\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[45.670754, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ CEO calls bank-api directly with full-scope token\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[46.682738, "o", "  \u001b[0;35m\u001b[1m[CEO]\u001b[0m As CEO, I can read ALL accounts and create new ones.\r\n\r\n"]
[46.682931, "o", "  \u001b[2m# CEO calls bank-api directly — no sandbox, no descoping\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m$ curl GET bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m(sub=ceo, scope has accounts.read)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[49.330081, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"email\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"openid accounts.read transfers.write profile email transfers.read accounts.write\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"accounts\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[1;39m[\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-001\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m5000000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"executive\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[49.330445, "o", "    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-002\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"analyst@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m85000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"standard\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-003\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"intern@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m32000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"standard\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[51.353387, "o", "\u001b[1m$ curl POST bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m(sub=ceo, scope has accounts.write)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[55.944815, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"message\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"account created\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"openid accounts.read transfers.write profile email transfers.read accounts.write\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[57.97668, "o", "  \u001b[0;32m\u001b[1mResult: CEO has full read AND write access to all bank data\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[60.990932, "o", "\r\n"]
[60.990986, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[60.991128, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 2: CEO delegates to AI agent — Token Exchange\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[62.001963, "o", "  \u001b[0;35m\u001b[1m[CEO]\u001b[0m I want my AI agent to review accounts for me.\r\n"]
[62.002037, "o", "  \u001b[0;35m\u001b[1m[CEO]\u001b[0m But it should \u001b[0;31mNOT be able to create accounts or initiate transfers\u001b[0m.\r\n"]
[62.002235, "o", "\r\n"]
[64.011677, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ How does the CEO delegate? → Keycloak RFC 8693 Token Exchange\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[65.022814, "o", "\r\n"]
[65.022891, "o", "  \u001b[1mThe flow:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  1. CEO already has a token from Step 1 (sub=ceo, all scopes)\r\n  2. The OpenShell gateway exchanges this token at Keycloak:\r\n"]
[65.022912, "o", "     - Sends the CEO token as \u001b[1msubject_token\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[65.022937, "o", "     - Requests a new token for the \u001b[0;36magent-sandbox\u001b[0m client\r\n"]
[65.022969, "o", "     - Keycloak checks: what scopes can agent-sandbox have?\r\n"]
[65.022982, "o", "       → only \u001b[0;32maccounts.read\u001b[0m and \u001b[0;32mtransfers.read\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[65.023137, "o", "       → \u001b[0;31mstrips accounts.write and transfers.write\u001b[0m\r\n  3. The new token keeps \u001b[0;35msub=ceo\u001b[0m but has \u001b[0;36mazp=agent-sandbox\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[68.031714, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Performing the token exchange\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[69.042003, "o", "\r\n"]
[69.042164, "o", "  \u001b[2m# The gateway exchanges the CEO token for a descoped agent token\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m# grant_type = RFC 8693 token exchange\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m# client_id  = agent-sandbox (the descoped client)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[69.042184, "o", "  \u001b[2m# subject_token = the CEO's full-scope token\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m$ curl -X POST $KEYCLOAK/realms/bank-demo/protocol/openid-connect/token \\033[0m\r\n\u001b[1m    -d grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange \\033[0m\r\n\u001b[1m    -d client_id=agent-sandbox \\033[0m\r\n"]
[69.042194, "o", "\u001b[1m    -d subject_token=$CEO_TOKEN \\033[0m\r\n"]
[69.042304, "o", "\u001b[1m    -d scope='accounts.read transfers.read'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[71.114619, "o", "\u001b[1mDescoped agent token:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.145829, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"preferred_username\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"email\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"openid accounts.read profile email transfers.read\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"azp\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"agent-sandbox\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.149816, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mWhat changed:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.149914, "o", "\r\n                         CEO token              Agent token (descoped)\r\n"]
[71.149928, "o", "    preferred_username   \u001b[0;35mceo\u001b[0m                    \u001b[0;35mceo\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m← same user\u001b[0m\r\n    email                \u001b[0;35mceo@bank.com\u001b[0m           \u001b[0;35mceo@bank.com\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m← same identity\u001b[0m\r\n    azp                  \u001b[0;32mopenshell-gateway\u001b[0m      \u001b[0;36magent-sandbox\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m← different client\u001b[0m\r\n    accounts.read        \u001b[0;32mYES\u001b[0m                    \u001b[0;32mYES\u001b[0m\r\n    accounts.write       \u001b[0;32mYES\u001b[0m                    \u001b[0;31mDENIED\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m← descoped by Keycloak\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.149942, "o", "    transfers.read       \u001b[0;32mYES\u001b[0m                    \u001b[0;32mYES\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.149961, "o", "    transfers.write      \u001b[0;32mYES\u001b[0m                    \u001b[0;31mDENIED\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m← descoped by Keycloak\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[75.158935, "o", "\r\n"]
[75.159109, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 3: AI agent calls bank-api with descoped token\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[76.169896, "o", "  \u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m[Agent]\u001b[0m I'm running in sandbox pod 'claude-sandbox' (namespace: claude-sandboxed).\r\n"]
[76.170017, "o", "  \u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m[Agent]\u001b[0m My token says I'm the CEO (sub=ceo), but my client is agent-sandbox (read-only).\r\n\r\n"]
[78.183989, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Agent reads accounts — ALLOWED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[79.19576, "o", "\r\n"]
[79.19585, "o", "  \u001b[2m# The agent calls bank-api from inside the sandbox\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m# Token: sub=ceo, azp=agent-sandbox, scope includes accounts.read\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[79.196082, "o", "\u001b[1m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- curl GET bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[79.196115, "o", "\r\n"]
[81.948745, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"email\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"openid accounts.read profile email transfers.read\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"accounts\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[1;39m[\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-001\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m5000000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"executive\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-002\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"analyst@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[81.948959, "o", "      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m85000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"standard\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-003\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"intern@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m32000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"standard\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[81.965777, "o", "\r\n"]
[81.965862, "o", "  \u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m[Agent]\u001b[0m I can see all the CEO's accounts. Read access works.\r\n"]
[84.977993, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Agent tries to CREATE an account — BLOCKED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[85.990399, "o", "\r\n"]
[85.990704, "o", "  \u001b[2m# Token: sub=ceo, azp=agent-sandbox, scope MISSING accounts.write\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- curl POST bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[88.365869, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"error\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"missing scope: accounts.write — agent is descoped to read-only\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"openid accounts.read profile email transfers.read\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[88.388803, "o", "\r\n"]
[88.389002, "o", "  \u001b[0;31m\u001b[1m[Agent]\u001b[0m 403 — I cannot create accounts. My token was descoped to read-only.\r\n"]
[91.400921, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Agent tries to TRANSFER funds — BLOCKED\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[92.410475, "o", "\r\n"]
[92.410643, "o", "  \u001b[2m# Token: sub=ceo, azp=agent-sandbox, scope MISSING transfers.write\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- curl POST bank-api/transfers\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[94.956981, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"error\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"missing scope: transfers.write — agent cannot initiate transfers\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"openid accounts.read profile email transfers.read\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[94.966885, "o", "\r\n"]
[94.966962, "o", "  \u001b[0;31m\u001b[1m[Agent]\u001b[0m 403 — I cannot initiate transfers. Blast radius reduced.\r\n"]
[97.971334, "o", "\r\n"]
[97.971502, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 4: What if the agent is compromised?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[98.981046, "o", "  \u001b[0;31m\u001b[1m[Attacker]\u001b[0m I've compromised the agent. Let me look for credentials...\r\n\r\n"]
[100.987334, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ No credential files in the sandbox\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[101.998677, "o", "\u001b[1m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- ls /sandbox/.config/gcloud/\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[103.400174, "o", "ls: cannot access '/sandbox/.config/gcloud/': No such file or directory\r\r\n"]
[103.443812, "o", "  ls: No such file or directory\r\n"]
[103.444039, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- printenv | grep -iE 'token|secret|key|password'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[104.87759, "o", "  (no secrets found)\r\n"]
[104.877833, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[0;31m\u001b[1m[Attacker]\u001b[0m Nothing here. No tokens, no keys, no secrets.\r\n"]
[107.888401, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Network exfiltration blocked by OPA policy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[108.897794, "o", "\u001b[1m$ openshell sandbox exec -n claude-sandbox -- curl -s https://httpbin.org/ip\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[110.381256, "o", "  (connection blocked by policy)\r\n\r\n"]
[110.381539, "o", "  \u001b[0;31m\u001b[1m[Attacker]\u001b[0m Can't reach external hosts either. The sandbox is locked down.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[0;32mEven a compromised agent has:\u001b[0m\r\n    - \u001b[0;32mNo credentials to steal\u001b[0m (tokens are injected by the proxy, not stored)\r\n"]
[110.381655, "o", "    - \u001b[0;32mNo network exfiltration\u001b[0m (OPA policy blocks unauthorized endpoints)\r\n    - \u001b[0;32mRead-only access only\u001b[0m (descoped token cannot write or transfer)\r\n"]
[114.391648, "o", "\r\n"]
[114.39195, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Summary — RHAIRFE-2567: User Identity Delegation\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[115.403625, "o", "\r\n"]
[115.40371, "o", "  \u001b[1mAcceptance Criteria\u001b[0m                        \u001b[1mStatus\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[115.403956, "o", "  AC1: Downstream sees user identity       \u001b[0;32mDEMONSTRATED\u001b[0m\r\n       Token: sub=ceo, email=ceo@bank.com\r\n       bank-api sees the CEO, not a service account\r\n\r\n  AC2: Works with any OIDC IdP             \u001b[0;32mDEMONSTRATED\u001b[0m\r\n       Standard RFC 8693 token exchange\r\n"]
[115.403983, "o", "       Keycloak today, Entra ID / Okta tomorrow\r\n\r\n"]
[115.404188, "o", "  AC3: Audit events                        \u001b[1;33mPARTIAL\u001b[0m\r\n       bank-api logs: user + scope + azp\r\n       OCSF delegation chain: future work\r\n\r\n"]
[115.404341, "o", "  \u001b[1mKey result:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;31mCEO blast radius REDUCED\u001b[0m\r\n  The agent acts as the CEO but cannot create accounts or transfer funds.\r\n  Even if compromised: read-only access, no credentials, no exfiltration.\r\n\r\n"]
[115.404442, "o", "  \u001b[2mRFE:     RHAIRFE-2567    Cluster: akram-dev (ROSA HCP 4.22)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mIdP:     RHBK v26.6      Sandbox: OpenShell v0.0.98\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[115.404478, "o", "\r\n"]
